      {
        "path": "python_programs/lcs_length.py",
        "new_content": "def lcs_length(s, t):\n    from collections import Counter\n\n    dp = Counter()\n\n    for i in range(len(s)):\n        for j in range(len(t)):\n            if s[i] == t[j]:\n                dp[i, j] = dp[i - 1, j - 1] + 1\n\n    return max(dp.values()) if dp else 0\n\n\n\n\"\"\"\nLongest Common Substring\nlongest-common-substring\n\nInput:\n    s: a string\n    t: a string\n\nOutput:\n    Length of the longest substring common to s and t\n\nExample:\n    >>> lcs_length('witch', 'sandwich')\n    2\n    >>> lcs_length('meow', 'homeowner')\n    4\n\"\"\"\n"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "该函数计算最长公共子串长度，但递推式错误地写成 dp[i-1, j] + 1，导致长度沿行方向累加而非沿对角线累加，破坏“连续子串”语义。改为 dp[i-1, j-1] + 1 后，仅当相邻字符连续匹配时才累加长度，符合最长公共子串定义；Counter 对负索引缺失项返回 0 也保证边界正确。",
